Renewal of 3G pitch surface and floodlights at Co-op Academy Failsworth, Manchester
Area - 102m x 63m

Scope of Works:
1. Preliminaries & Site Establishment;
2. Site Clearance;
3. Supply and Install 3G Synthetic Turf;
4. Reinstatement;
5. Testing and Commissioning;
6. A suitable warranty to be provided for the pitch;
7. New goals and nets to be provided;
8. Replacement of floodlights to LED for MUGA.


To access this competition: 

Registered:
Login to https://suppliers.multiquo

Below is a summary please refer to the Job pack for detailed information 

Thetford Town Council is seeking to appoint a single consultant practice to undertake the roles of:
•	Lead Designer;
•	Architect;
•	Conservation Architect;
•	Principal Designer (CDM Regulations);
•	Principal Designer (Building Safety Act).
